WEBVTT

00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:01.893
The mandem make some noise

00:08:01.917 --> 00:08:06.476
(Cheering)

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:12.893
(Applause)

00:08:12.917 --> 00:08:15.976
This next one is partly in Kiswahili,

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.518
which is what we speak in Kenya.

00:08:18.542 --> 00:08:21.893
And it's about female friendship

00:08:21.917 --> 00:08:23.434
and female power.

00:08:23.458 --> 00:08:26.684
And girls coming together
to build something that lasts,

00:08:26.708 --> 00:08:29.934
a true legacy and intergenerational worth.

00:08:29.958 --> 00:08:31.250
"Suzie Noma."